      "text": "Four different treatments were tested in a human volunteer during a year. One of these treatments was a vaccine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The treatments were injected into the volunteer and blood samples were taken after two weeks. The samples were analysed to obtain a cell count for four types of cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The results are shown in the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Which treatment was the vaccine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(Assume the volunteer's baseline blood cell count was the same before each treatment.)"
